	(59941,55664,10424,0,7340032,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,59940,0,178051,1,'Re-sizing the Situation','I call this gadget "the Re-Sizer." It\'s what I used to unshrink the Choppy Booster Mk. 5.

