	(59942,55664,10424,0,40894464,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,59941,0,0,0,'The Re-Deather','I got the perfect plan. You\'re gonna ride the Choppy Booster Mk. 5 and BLAST those walkin\' cadavers from the sky!

