	(65436,55664,13642,0,38273024,10,70,0,2971683917,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,205456,1,'The Dragon Isles Await','Wondrous news, my friend! The Dragon Isles are awakening!

My people left our lands dormant in the wake of the Sundering. But now, at long last, we feel the call to home.

