	(47945,65299,8721,0,54525960,20,60,0,2973060173,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,47982,0,0,0,'To Market, To Market','Thanks heaps for getting us out of that pickle, mainlander. I\'d hate to ask, but would you be willing to help with another matter?

