	(49556,65299,5785,0,1048648,10,35,0,2973060173,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,29548,0,0,'Hero\'s Call: Jade Forest!','All able-bodied citizens of the Alliance are to report to Stormwind Keep in Stormwind.

Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth is assembling a team for a high priority mission.

