Can you go get Orweyna and bring her back here? See if she\'ll talk this beast into letting me go?

I\'m not an elekk plushie, for cryin\' out loud.','Go get Orweyna in the Den and find a way to free Gazlowe.','I\'m pleased that Monte came this way to visit. But I can see that he is as out of his depth here as I was in Undermine.','Never try to take something from a beast like this without offering something better. 

